@startuml activity-approve-expense
title Activity: approve or reject a pending expense\nFR-004, FR-021, FR-022, FR-025 to FR-029, FR-031, FR-034, FR-047, FR-049; NFR-001, NFR-002, NFR-005, NFR-006, NFR-010, NFR-011\nScenarios US4-AS2, US4-AS3, US4-AS4, US4-AS9, US4-AS10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Approver|
start
:Open the expense from the approvals inbox
or from a notification (FR-023);
:Choose Approve, or Reject with a reason;
|Swing UI|
if (Reject with a blank reason?) then (yes)
  :Field message: a rejection reason is required,
  entry kept (FR-028, NFR-005);
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Allocate operation UUID, disable both buttons,
show loading, call approve or reject on a worker (NFR-011);
|ApprovalService|
:CommandRunner: lock the expense's group,
open one UnitOfWork (D-2);
if (Operation ID already recorded?) then (same request)
  :Recheck access, return the prior result,
  no second decision or notification (US4-AS10);
  |Swing UI|
  :Show the recorded outcome;
  stop
else (new)
endif
|UnitOfWork (H2)|
:Load active membership, expense, approver set
and genuine decisions;
|ApprovalService|
if (Actor is an active member of the group?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Access denied, no group content shown
  (FR-004, NFR-002, US7-AS8);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (Expense status is PENDING?) then (no: APPROVED, REJECTED or CANCELLED)
  |Swing UI|
  :Conflict: the expense is already decided or was
  cancelled by a lifecycle event. Nothing changes,
  prior decisions and cancellation history stay
  visible (FR-047, FR-049, US4-AS9, US4-AS10);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (ApprovalPolicy: actor is a required approver\nwho has not decided yet?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Refused: not an approver, the creator,
  or a repeated decision (FR-026, US4-AS4);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (Decision?) then (reject)
  :Outcome REJECTED at once, whatever the other
  approvers did (FR-028, US4-AS3). Outcome notification:
  EXPENSE_REJECTED with the reason, to the creator (FR-021);
else (approve)
  if (ApprovalPolicy.outcome with this approval:\nhave all approvers approved?) then (no)
    :Outcome stays PENDING,
    no outcome notification (US4-AS2);
  else (yes)
    :Outcome APPROVED, immutable from now on
    (FR-027, FR-047). Outcome notification:
    EXPENSE_APPROVED to the creator (FR-021);
  endif
endif
|UnitOfWork (H2)|
:In the same UnitOfWork insert the genuine ApprovalDecision
(actor, Clock time, reason when rejected; FR-029),
the status change and outcome notification if any,
and the operation result COMMITTED;
:Commit all of them together (D-2);
note right
  No balance row and no posting is written.
  Balances are derived later from APPROVED shares.
  FR-022: the creator is never an approver, so an
  outcome notification is always caused by another
  member and is never suppressed.
end note
if (Commit result?) then (committed)
  |Swing UI|
  :Show the new status and decision history
  (actor and time; lifecycle events listed
  separately, FR-029);
  :Refresh balances on a worker: BalanceService
  derives pair balances from APPROVED shares and
  CONFIRMED payments; group sum = 0.00
  (FR-031, FR-034, NFR-001);
  stop
elseif (Commit result?) then (failed)
  |Swing UI|
  :Rolled back: no decision, status or notification
  saved, NOT_COMMITTED; buttons re-enabled
  (US4-AS10, NFR-010);
  stop
else (uncertain)
  |Swing UI|
  :Outcome UNKNOWN; look up the operation ID
  before any retry (US1-AS9, NFR-010);
  stop
endif
@enduml
